    "created_at": "2016-01-31T01:08:37Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-01-31T01:08:37Z",
    "body": "It's possible I misunderstood what was being proposed when filing that bug, but being able to assign a `FontFace` object, the way that object is specified right now, doesn't help with being able to use those properties. It lets you use `font-settings` _descriptor_, but you can already do that by referring to the `FontFace` object by name in the `font` IDL attribute.\n",
